  "correct_approach": "In turn 2, after `create_ticket` returns, immediately invoke `get_user_tickets` in the same tool_calls array (before narrative) to confirm ticket #2 was created, ticket_counter incremented, and queue state updated. This atomic chain ensures TicketAPI instance state remains synchronized with ground truth across all subsequent turns.",
  "key_insight": "Multi-turn ticket operations require post-mutation verification: `create_ticket` → `get_user_tickets` (same turn, atomic). Omitting this chain breaks state parity; ground truth expects instance mutations to be validated before proceeding to dependent operations."
